## Component 1: Icon

**Path:** `src/components/common/Icon.jsx`

Production-grade Lucide icon with variants, labels, accessibility, and badge support.

```jsx
import { Icon } from '@/components/common';

// Basic usage
<Icon name="ShoppingCart" variant="cyan" size={24} />

